# ONI macOS Paths

Do **not** full-disk search for mods. Use these paths (expand `~` to `$HOME`).

Steam AppID: **457140**.

## Mods (lookup order)

| Purpose | Path |
|---------|------|
| Workshop **installed** (prefer) | `~/Library/Application Support/unity.Klei.Oxygen Not Included/mods/Steam/<WorkshopID>/` |
| Workshop **raw** Steam cache | `~/Library/Application Support/Steam/steamapps/workshop/content/457140/<WorkshopID>/` |
| Local Dev deploy | `~/Library/Application Support/unity.Klei.Oxygen Not Included/mods/Dev/<ModName>/` |
| Enable list | `~/Library/Application Support/unity.Klei.Oxygen Not Included/mods/mods.json` |
| Mod configs | `~/Library/Application Support/unity.Klei.Oxygen Not Included/mods/` and `mods/config/` |

- Prefer `mods/Steam/<id>/` (DLL + yaml). Raw cache may be only `*_legacy.bin` (zip).
- `mods.json`: Spaced Out enable = `enabledForDlc` contains `EXPANSION1_ID`. Do **not** treat `enabled: false` alone as disabled.
- Windows docs path `Documents\Klei\OxygenNotIncluded\` is usually **absent** on Mac; use `unity.Klei.Oxygen Not Included` instead.

## Game, refs, logs, saves

| Purpose | Path |
|---------|------|
| Game install | `~/Library/Application Support/Steam/steamapps/common/OxygenNotIncluded/` |
| Managed assemblies | `…/OxygenNotIncluded.app/Contents/Resources/Data/Managed/` |
| Player.log | `~/Library/Logs/Klei/Oxygen Not Included/Player.log` |
| Saves | `~/Library/Application Support/unity.Klei.Oxygen Not Included/save_files/` |

Repo build refs: `Directory.Build.props.user` (gitignored) — not the paths above.
